<title>USA: Sturm, Ruger names Erle Blanchard CFO.</title>
<headline>Sturm, Ruger names Erle Blanchard CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHPORT, Conn. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sturm, Ruger &amp; Co Inc said on Friday it named Erle Blanchard chief financial officer, replacing John Kingsley Jr., who was retiring.</p>
<p>Blanchard had been vice president-controller, the company said. He joined the company in 1979 to head the finance department of the Newport, N.H. firearms division.</p>
<p>Sturm, Ruger makes firearms for recreation and law enforcement, and produces precision investment cast titanium, steel and aluminum components.</p>
<p>((--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
